At Beat22, we’ve made the licensing process **fully automatic,** so you can focus on selling beats, not chasing paperwork. Here’s how it works: **Step 1: Buyer Purchases Your Beat** Once a buyer completes the checkout process, the system instantly captures the details of the transaction, beat name, license type, price, and buyer info. **Step 2: License & Contract Auto-Generated** Right after the payment, Beat22’s system **automatically creates a legally binding license agreement** between you (the seller) and the buyer. No manual work No separate contract needed License includes all terms, usage rights, publishing %, master rights, etc. **Step 3: Delivered to Buyer + You** The finalized license is sent instantly to the buyer via email and is also available for both parties to download from their Beat22 dashboard. **Why This Matters for You as a Seller:**

-   You **don’t need to draft or upload** any contract manually
-   The license is **professional and legally valid**
-   You can **focus on music** while we take care of the business side

**Beat sold. License handled. Contract ready, all in seconds.**
